        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>三角形的稳定性 - 第十一章</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"STSong\", serif;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    color: #222;\n    max-width: 700px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 30px 25px 15px 25px;\n  }\n  p {\n    margin: 4px 0;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n  }\n  .no-indent {\n    text-indent: 0;\n  }\n  .img-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    margin: 15px 0 5px 0;\n  }\n  .img-block {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    width: 45%;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 130px;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #f2f2f2, #f2f2f2 10px, #e8e8e8 10px, #e8e8e8 20px);\n    border: 1px solid #bbb;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #777;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 4px;\n  }\n  .img-caption {\n    margin-top: 6px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  .fig-caption {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    margin: 8px 0 15px 0;\n  }\n  .exercise-box {\n    border: 2px dashed #e0a030;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    margin: 25px 0;\n    padding: 20px 25px 25px 25px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .exercise-label {\n    background: #f2a83c;\n    color: #fff;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: 3px 18px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -14px;\n    left: 20px;\n  }\n  .exercise-question {\n    margin-top: 15px;\n    text-indent: 0;\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n  }\n  .shapes-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 25px 15px;\n    margin-top: 20px;\n  }\n  .shape-block {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .shape-placeholder {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 90px;\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid #999;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #888;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .shape-num {\n    margin-top: 6px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    text-align: right;\n    margin-top: 40px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <p>还可以发现，斜钉一根木条的四边形木架的形状不会改变．这是因为斜钉一根木条后，四边形变成两个三角形，由于三角形有稳定性，斜钉一根木条的窗框在未安装好之前也不会变形．</p>\n\n  <p>三角形的稳定性有广泛的应用，图 11.1-8 表示其中一些例子．你能再举一些例子吗？</p>\n\n  <div class=\"img-row\">\n    <div class=\"img-block\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 钢架桥 — steel truss bridge over water, triangular framework]</div>\n      <div class=\"img-caption\">钢架桥</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"img-block\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 起重机 — yellow crane with triangular lattice arm]</div>\n      <div class=\"img-caption\">起重机</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"fig-caption\">图 11.1-8</div>\n\n  <p>四边形的不稳定性也有广泛的应用，图 11.1-9 表示其中一些例子．</p>\n\n  <div class=\"img-row\">\n    <div class=\"img-block\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 活动挂架 — orange expandable X-shaped rack]</div>\n      <div class=\"img-caption\">活动挂架</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"img-block\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 伸缩门 — metal expandable/retractable gate]</div>\n      <div class=\"img-caption\">伸缩门</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"fig-caption\">图 11.1-9</div>\n\n  <div class=\"exercise-box\">\n    <span class=\"exercise-label\">练习</span>\n    <p class=\"exercise-question\">下列图形中哪些具有稳定性？</p>\n\n    <div class=\"shapes-grid\">\n      <div class=\"shape-block\">\n        <div class=\"shape-placeholder\">[Shape: triangle with diagonal support lines]</div>\n        <div class=\"shape-num\">(1)</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"shape-block\">\n        <div class=\"shape-placeholder\">[Shape: rectangle with one horizontal midline]</div>\n        <div class=\"shape-num\">(2)</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"shape-block\">\n        <div class=\"shape-placeholder\">[Shape: pentagon (house-like, no diagonals)]</div>\n        <div class=\"shape-num\">(3)</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"shape-block\">\n        <div class=\"shape-placeholder\">[Shape: irregular pentagon with internal diagonal lines]</div>\n        <div class=\"shape-num\">(4)</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"shape-block\">\n        <div class=\"shape-placeholder\">[Shape: irregular hexagon, no diagonals]</div>\n        <div class=\"shape-num\">(5)</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"shape-block\">\n        <div class=\"shape-placeholder\">[Shape: regular hexagon with all diagonals from center]</div>\n        <div class=\"shape-num\">(6)</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">第十一章 三角形　7</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
